menu "Makeshift Flipper C6 -- Ask AI (Ollama bridge)"

    config MAKESHIFT_OLLAMA_HOST
        string "Ollama host (PC's LAN IP or hostname)"
        default "192.168.4.27"
        help
            Where the PC running Ollama (https://ollama.com) lives on the
            local network. Set this to that PC's actual LAN IP (or a
            hostname, if your network resolves it) before flashing --
            previously this was a hardcoded #define in wifi_commands.c
            that had to be edited and rebuilt by hand; it's now set here
            via "idf.py menuconfig" so it doesn't need a source edit, and
            so a stale/wrong address is easier to notice and fix (see
            KNOWN_ISSUES.md for the "Ask AI questions silently go to the
            wrong device" risk this was flagged for).

    config MAKESHIFT_OLLAMA_PORT
        int "Ollama port"
        default 11434
        help
            Ollama's default REST API port. Only change this if you've
            reconfigured Ollama to listen elsewhere.

    config MAKESHIFT_OLLAMA_MODEL
        string "Ollama model name"
        default "qwen3:8b"
        help
            Must match a model already pulled on the PC (e.g. via
            "ollama pull qwen3:8b") -- see c6-firmware/README.md.
            qwen3:8b replaced qwen2.5vl:3b after testing showed noticeably
            better Turkish answer quality for the same prompt.

    config MAKESHIFT_DEBUG_SERVER_HOST
        string "Debug AI server host (PC's LAN IP or hostname)"
        default "192.168.4.27"
        help
            Where debug_server.py (c6-firmware/tools/debug_server.py) runs
            on the local network -- usually the same PC as Ollama, often
            the same address as MAKESHIFT_OLLAMA_HOST above, but kept as a
            separate setting since it's a different port/process and
            could run elsewhere. Used by the device's automatic "Debug AI"
            feature to send the most recent error for diagnosis and
            logging as soon as it happens -- see c6-firmware/README.md.

    config MAKESHIFT_DEBUG_SERVER_PORT
        int "Debug AI server port"
        default 8765
        help
            Must match PORT in debug_server.py.

endmenu
